            "review_title": "Review at L'Usine Phu My Hung",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n27\nUpmarket cafe in Crescent Mall\nJan 2025 • Solo\nI just moved to this area and was wondering around the very large Crescent Mall and at the end came across L’Usine, one of my favourite cafe/restaurant chains in Vietnam.\n\nI noticed they had a power lunch special and decided on lunch and dessert.\n\nI started with Crab & Avacado Salad with wakame seaweed, endamame, and miso dressing followed by a very tradition Chicken rice for my main and finally fried bananas with coconut gelato with hot caramel sauce and caramel bites. All dishes were spot on, and the service was super friendly. My favourite dish was the salad, it was so fresh tasting and the flavours were a perfect complement to each other. I was very happy to have stopped here for lunch. In the past when i lived in Bến Nghé, the local L’Usine was my favourite for brunches, as they also do a fabulous breakfast!\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2025",
