            "review_title": "Review at L'Usine Phu My Hung",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nA Very Good Experience Overall\nOct 2020\nI enjoy the L'Usine branches very much and this was the first time I visited the District 7 branch. I thought the décor was super stylish and the staff were friendly. I ordered my favourite dish - the chicken burger in a bun with coleslaw and French fries and spicy mayo, but when it arrived it was all very luke warm. This is not the first time this has happened at a L'Usine restaurant and it normally happens when there are a group of people. There were 10 of us at the time Two other friends also complained that their meals were cold, so we asked the waitress to please ask the chef to reheat the food. In fairness, it came back all piping hot which is why this restaurant received a very good rating rather than poor. I look forward to returning there again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 7, 2021\nL Concepts C\nDear Leean W,\n\nThank you for sharing your feedback with us! We are glad to know that you enjoyed your overall experience at L'Usine. We will note your feedback for future improvements. We aim high on bringing our customers the most delightful experience, your feedback means a lot to us! \n\nLooking forward to welcoming you again soon!\n\nSincerely,\n\nL'Usine Team\nRead more\nWritten February 26, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
