            "review_title": "Review at L'Usine Phu My Hung",
            "review_text": "stella a\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam34 contributions\n0\nNot friendly for Takeaway orders. Need improvement\nFeb 2020 • Solo\nVery disappointed in this day and age that they do not have a good take-away order system. \n\nI called to place to place a takeaway order. After the restaurant got all my requests, I asked how long it would take for the food to be ready and it was only then that she said they wouldn’t prepare the food until i arrived to pay. So ok, i cancelled the phone order and sent my husband to order in-person. Upon arrival and payment, my husband was told it would be ready in 15 minutes. But 30 minutes later, it was still not ready. We had placed an order for 4 items. Does it take 30 minutes for food to arrive at the restaurant too? That is too long!\n\nRestaurants should understand that the purpose of takeaway orders is convenience and time savings. Needless to say, I won’t order from here again.\nRead more\nWritten February 22, 2020\nL Concepts C\nDear Stella A,\n\nThank you for taking the time to write a review about L'Usine. \n\nOur sincere apologies for the unpleasant experience you had at L’Usine Phu Mt Hung. We aim high on bringing our customers the most delightful experience, your feedback means a lot to us and have shared this to our team for improvement.\n\nWe would like to invite you back at L’Usine and offer you service recovery. Please do let us know when you will visit us, our team will be pleased to welcoming you back and ensure that you will have a great experience.\n\nSincerely, \nL'Usine Team\nRead more\nWritten February 28, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
