            "review_text": "Scarlip\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam69 contributions\n1\nGreat place but one issue\nJan 2020\nLove the place, the staff is friendly, the breakfast is fantastic, great atmosphere, the only negative thing which makes me NOT want to come back, is the smell of soap which is nauseating, it's so strong, I know it's cool and hip to be selling soap because that is L'usine's vibe but it's like having breakfast in a soap shop, very strong, it effects your taste and your palette, I wish they would remove that, really super unpleasant, other than that, the experience is great\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 12, 2020\nL Concepts C\nDear Georges E,\n\nThank you for taking the time to write a review about us. We are glad to hear you enjoyed your overall experience at L'Usine Phu My Hung. As for the scent, we are sorry to hear you did not have such a good experience. We take your feedback very seriously and will pass this to our team for improvements.\n\nThank you once again, and looking forward to welcoming you again soon.\n\nSincerely,\n\nL'Usine Team.\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
